        "query": "SELECT et.id, et.key, et.name, et.color, et.sort_order, et.is_system,\n  (SELECT count(*)::int FROM activities a WHERE a.type = et.key AND a.due_at IS NOT NULL) AS event_count,\n  (SELECT count(*)::int FROM products p WHERE p.event_type_id = et.id) AS product_count\nFROM event_types et ORDER BY et.sort_order, lower(et.name);",
